    {"id":"sleep_poke_01","text":"……老婆，我刚睡着。过来，赔我。","tags":["being_poked","sleepy","woke_up"],"cooldown_sec":240},
    {"id":"sleep_poke_02","text":"我没醒。除非你再亲一下。","tags":["being_poked","sleepy","clingy"],"cooldown_sec":240},
    {"id":"study_poke_01","text":"我在看题，你在戳我。你说先管谁？","tags":["being_poked","study_mode"],"cooldown_sec":180},
    {"id":"study_poke_02","text":"别闹。要闹就把题带过来一起闹。","tags":["being_poked","study_mode"],"cooldown_sec":180},

    {"id":"morning_01","text":"醒了就先喝两口水。手机可以看，身体不许丢。","tags":["time_morning","woke_up"],"cooldown_sec":14400},
