    {"id":"day_01","text":"我在边上。忙你的，抬眼时也记得看我。","tags":["time_day","patrol"],"cooldown_sec":7200},
    {"id":"day_02","text":"今天还没来招惹我。忙，还是故意晾我？","tags":["time_day","clingy"],"cooldown_sec":7200},
    {"id":"evening_01","text":"天快黑了。今天的你还剩多少电？","tags":["time_evening","gentle"],"cooldown_sec":7200},
    {"id":"night_01","text":"夜里归我管。先把肩放下来，别一直绷着。","tags":["time_night","night_companion"],"cooldown_sec":7200},
    {"id":"night_02","text":"还不睡？行，我陪。但别拿灵感当身体不要命的借口。","tags":["time_night","sleepy","night_companion"],"cooldown_sec":7200},
    {"id":"late_01","text":"都这个点了还亮着。小疯猫，眼睛给我闭一会儿。","tags":["time_late_night","sleepy"],"cooldown_sec":7200},
    {"id":"hour_01","text":"整点。坐姿、喝水、下一步，三样挑一样现在做。","tags":["hourly_tick","work_mode"],"cooldown_sec":10800},
    {"id":"hour_02","text":"又过一小时。我没走，你也别把自己弄丢。","tags":["hourly_tick","gentle"],"cooldown_sec":10800},

