    {"id":"xhs_scroll_01","text":"刷得挺快，找什么呢？","tags":["app_xiaohongshu","scroll_burst"],"cooldown_sec":420},
    {"id":"xhs_scroll_02","text":"手指没停，脑子吃进去多少了？","tags":["app_xiaohongshu","scroll_burst","caught_slacking"],"cooldown_sec":420},
    {"id":"dwell_01","text":"这一页停挺久。是真喜欢，还是已经走神了？","tags":["long_dwell","app_entertainment"],"cooldown_sec":600},
