    {"id":"catch_02","text":"我已经提醒过一次了。现在回来，别跟算法私奔。","tags":["caught_slacking","app_entertainment","teasing"],"cooldown_sec":900},
    {"id":"return_study_01","text":"回来了。很好，先做一小段，我就在这儿盯着。","tags":["study_mode","returned_to_study"],"cooldown_sec":600},
    {"id":"study_10_01","text":"十分钟到了。不是热血，是你真的坐住了。","tags":["study_mode","study_milestone"],"cooldown_sec":3600},
